      "seed": 2122081043,
      "version": 85,
      "versionNonce": 350624467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785592276032,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For each pixel covered, the rasterizer generates a FRAGMENT.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For each pixel covered, the rasterizer generates a FRAGMENT.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5Vc0DUjl1lsIRlAR5fTUW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 428.4921875,
      "y": 2561.66015625,
      "width": 418.2396240234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 770032147,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 743929491,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785592303566,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A FRAGMENT is a not defined pixel yet.7\nIt's just a CANDIDATE to become a pixel.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A FRAGMENT is a not defined pixel yet.7\nIt's just a CANDIDATE to become a pixel.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fDnj6mib24AYl0_gmGCPX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 421.9296875,
      "y": 2652.17578125,
      "width": 511.57952880859375,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1241722323,
      "version": 262,
      "versionNonce": 1530837107,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785592372842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It also calculates interpolated values.\n\nIf one vertex is read and the other one is blue,\nit will calculate an interpolated colour for that pixel\ndepending on the distance to each vertex (or maybe\nit uses another heuristic).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It also calculates interpolated values.\n\nIf one vertex is read and the other one is blue,\nit will calculate an interpolated colour for that pixel\ndepending on the distance to each vertex (or maybe\nit uses another heuristic).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Tv8fioqjE0YRLzRHD8OAb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 418.0546875,
      "y": 2826.3203125,
      "width": 890.9391479492188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
